(Panel 2 \(Notification\): Nearby registered donor receives push notification while working) Tj
T*
(at desk.) Tj
T*
(Panel 3 \(Friction Encountered\): Notification reads 'Emergency: Go to Central Hospital'.) Tj
T*
(Donor doesn't know parking availability, current line wait, or eligibility criteria.) Tj
T*
(Panel 4 \(Emotional Hesitation\): Donor assumes someone else will go; dismisses) Tj
T*
(notification.) Tj
T*
(Panel 5 \(Redesigned Flow\): Push notification provides one-click taxi voucher, exact) Tj
T*
(arrival gate, and countdown timer showing 'Only 2 donors needed in your area'.) Tj
T*
(Panel 6 \(Resolution\): Donor accepts; blood bank confirms arrival; donor receives digital) Tj
T*
(badge and health update.) Tj
T*
(Outcome: Refactored notifications based on the storyboard increased donor acceptance) Tj
T*
(rates from 5% to 48%.) Tj
T*
() Tj
